mon pitfalls of all 17 components",[327,334,335,336,340,341,344,345,348],{},"Form validation with ",[337,338,339],"code",{},"UForm",", ",[337,342,343],{},"UFormField"," and Valibot, and the shared rules (",[337,346,347],{},"requiredText"," and others)",[327,350,351],{},"The empty-value contract of each component and how to initialize state",[327,353,354],{},"The query card with a result list and server-side pagination",[327,356,357,358,361],{},"The ",[337,359,360],{},"shuoUi"," module options: site-wide defaults, locales and messages, theming",[327,363,364],{},"Display utilities for dates, numbers, phones and months",[305,366,367,368,373],{},"The skill includes additional references that the AI agent loads on demand based on the task, keeping responses focused and context-efficient. When it needs a full props table or more examples, the skill points the agent to the ",[369,370,372],"a",{"href":371},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fagents\u002Fllms-txt#markdown-version-of-a-single-page","markdown version"," of the matching docs page.",[375,376,377,378,381],"note",{},"Once installed, you can invoke the skill by typing ",[337,379,380],{},"\u002Fshuo-ui"," in your agent's chat.",[383,384,386],"h3",{"id":385},"skills-cli","Skills CLI",[305,388,357,389,397],{},[369,390,394],{"href":391,"rel":392},"https:\u002F\u002Fskills.sh",[393],"nofollow",[337,395,396],{},"skills"," CLI is the easiest way to install the Shuo UI skill. It supports many agents, including Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, Windsurf and Cline.",[399,400,405],"pre",{"className":401,"code":402,"language":403,"meta":404,"style":404},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","npx skills add k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui\n","bash","",[337,406,407],{"__ignoreMap":404},[408,409,412,416,420,423],"span",{"class":410,"line":411},"line",1,[408,413,415],{"class":414},"sBMFI","npx",[408,417,419],{"class":418},"sfazB"," skills",[408,421,422],{"class":418}," add",[408,424,425],{"class":418}," k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui\n",[305,427,428,429,432],{},"Target specific agents with the ",[337,430,431],{},"--agent"," flag:",[399,434,436],{"className":401,"code":435,"language":403,"meta":404,"style":404},"npx skills add k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui --agent cursor\nnpx skills add k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui --agent claude-code\n",[337,437,438,455],{"__ignoreMap":404},[408,439,440,442,444,446,449,452],{"class":410,"line":411},[408,441,415],{"class":414},[408,443,419],{"class":418},[408,445,422],{"class":418},[408,447,448],{"class":418}," k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui",[408,450,451],{"class":418}," --agent",[408,453,454],{"class":418}," cursor\n",[408,456,458,460,462,464,466,468],{"class":410,"line":457},2,[408,459,415],{"class":414},[408,461,419],{"class":418},[408,463,422],{"class":418},[408,465,448],{"class":418},[408,467,451],{"class":418},[408,469,470],{"class":418}," claude-code\n",[305,472,473],{},"Or install globally so the skill is available across all your projects:",[399,475,477],{"className":401,"code":476,"language":403,"meta":404,"style":404},"npx skills add k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui --global\n",[337,478,479],{"__ignoreMap":404},[408,480,481,483,485,487,489],{"class":410,"line":411},[408,482,415],{"class":414},[408,484,419],{"class":418},[408,486,422],{"class":418},[408,488,448],{"class":418},[408,490,491],{"class":418}," --global\n",[305,493,494],{},"If cloning from GitHub is slow on your network, you can install directly from the docs site instead:",[399,496,498],{"className":401,"code":497,"language":403,"meta":404,"style":404},"npx skills add https:\u002F\u002Fk90325248.github.io\u002Fshuo-ui\n",[337,499,500],{"__ignoreMap":404},[408,501,502,504,506,508],{"class":410,"line":411},[408,503,415],{"class":414},[408,505,419],{"class":418},[408,507,422],{"class":418},[408,509,510],{"class":418}," https:\u002F\u002Fk90325248.github.io\u002Fshuo-ui\n",[512,513,514,515,519],"tip",{},"Visit ",[369,516,518],{"href":391,"rel":517},[393],"skills.sh"," to learn more about the 